body:

Adds a like button to every post and shows who liked it.

After installing, run the migrations with `flaskbb db upgrade`.

Forked from [flaskbb-plugin-vanity](https://github.com/micha030201/flaskbb-plugin-vanity) by Михаил Лебедев.
